        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">The cuticle of the segment of the leg that is composed of tarsomeres connected to each other by intertarsomeral conjunctiva. The first tarsomere is connected to the distal margin of the tibia by the tibio-tarsal conjunctiva.</owl:annotatedTarget>
