https://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043

&quot;An articulated mesal appendage, the lacinia mobilis or prostheca, occurs in several groups. It can be sclerotized or largely membranous and is often equipped with microtrichia.&quot;</obo:AISM_0000171>
