https://ipmhouse.tamu.edu/files/2021/03/The-Torre-Bueno-Glossary-of-Entomology.pdf

&quot;mandibular region set with hair&quot;</obo:AISM_0000171>
        <oboI:creation_date>2022-06-20</oboI:creation_date>
