https://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043

&quot;The preoral cavity is the space enclosed between the labrum and labium and the paired mandibles and maxillae&quot;</obo:AISM_0000171>
        <x_1.1:contributor>jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883</x_1.1:contributor>
        <oboI:creation_date>2023-01-09</oboI:creation_date>
