        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">insect mouth</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:AISM_0000171 xml:lang="en">Snodgrass RE (1993) Principles of Insect Morphology. Cornell University Press, 768 pp.

https://www.jstor.org/stable/10.7591/j.ctv1nhm1j

&quot;Mouth. The external opening of the stomodaeum, situated in the ventral wall of the head between the labrum and the hypopharynx.&quot;</obo:AISM_0000171>
        <x_1.1:contributor>jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883</x_1.1:contributor>
