https://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043

&quot;Sensilla are the basal functional and structural units of cuticular mechanoreceptors and chemoreceptors. They include the cuticular component (e.g., the cuticle of a seta), the sensory neuron (or neurons), the associated sheath cells with the cavities they enclose and the structures they produce&quot; p. 5.</obo:AISM_0000171>
