        <obo:IAO_0000115>A stem cell that can give rise to the cells of the liver. The term usually refers to the self-renewing pool of hepatocyte precursors in the adult liver (differently from &apos;hepatoblast&apos;, often used for fetal precursors of hepatocytes).</obo:IAO_0000115>
