        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0032501"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The whole of the physical, chemical, and biochemical processes carried out by multicellular organisms to break down ingested nutrients into components that may be easily absorbed and directed into metabolism.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboI:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Digestion</oboI:hasDbXref>
