        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which a highly ordered sequence of patterning events generates the branched epithelial tubes of the lung, consisting of reiterated combinations of bud outgrowth, elongation, and dichotomous subdivision of terminal units.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboI:hasExactSynonym>lung branching morphogenesis</oboI:hasExactSynonym>
