        <obo:IAO_0000115>The biological process whose specific outcome is the progression of a chorion from an initial condition to its mature state. This process begins with the formation of the structure and ends with the mature structure. The chorion is an extraembryonic membrane.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboI:creation_date>2009-06-11T02:37:50Z</oboI:creation_date>
        <oboI:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboI:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboI:id>GO:0060717</oboI:id>
        <rdfs:label>chorion development</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
