        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which relatively unspecialized cells of the ectoplacental cone acquire specialized structural and/or functional features that characterize chorionic trophoblasts. These cells will migrate towards the spongiotrophoblast layer and give rise to syncytiotrophoblasts of the labyrinthine layer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboI:creation_date>2009-06-11T02:48:27Z</oboI:creation_date>
        <oboI:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboI:hasOBONamespace>
