            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The biological process whose specific outcome is the progression of a mesonephric mesenchyme from an initial condition to its mature state. This process begins with the formation of mesonephric mesenchyme and ends with the mature structure. Mesonephric mesenchyme is the tissue made up of loosely connected mesenchymal cells in the mesonephros.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboI:creation_date>2010-08-17T03:45:44Z</oboI:creation_date>
        <oboI:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboI:hasOBONamespace>
