            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which an organism retains a population of mesenchymal stem cells that contributes to the shaping of a nephron. A mesenchymal stem cell is a cell that retains the ability to divide and proliferate throughout life to provide progenitor cells that can differentiate into specialized mesenchymal cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
