        <obo:IAO_0000115>The progression of the vascular cord over time from its initial formation until its mature state. The vascular cord is the primordial vasculature that will develop into blood vessels by the process of tubulogenesis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboI:creation_date>2010-11-16T11:46:55Z</oboI:creation_date>
        <oboI:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboI:hasOBONamespace>
