        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any of the nuclei that comprise the superior olivary complex (superior olive). This includes both the primary nuclei such as the lateral and medial nuclei, as well as periolivary nuclei.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>this class exists largely for consistency with the FMA. It is defined trivially with respect to the SOC. The class may be removed in future.</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <oboI:hasDbXref>FMA:72246</oboI:hasDbXref>
